ype="uri" xlink:href="http://www.fda.gov/cder/guidance/6400fnl.pdf">http://www.fda.gov/cder/guidance/6400fnl.pdf</ext-link>. Accessed 11 August 2006</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040209-b013"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Guiding principles Processing Joint FDA EMEA Voluntary Genomic Data Submissions (VGDSs) within the framework of the Confidentiality Arrangement</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.emea.eu.int/pdfs/general/direct/pr/FDAEMEA.pdf">http://www.emea.eu.int/pdfs/general/direct/pr/FDAEMEA.pdf</ext-link>. Accessed 28 December 2006</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040209-b014"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Kirchheiner</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Fuhr</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Brockmoller</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Pharmacogenetics-based therapeutic recommendations&#x02014;Ready for clinical practice?</article-title><source>Nat Rev Drug Discov</source><volume>4</volume><fpage>639</fpage><lpage>647</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16056390</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040209-b015"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Maitland</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>DiRienzo</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Ratain</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Interpreting disparate responses to cancer therapy: The role of human population genetics</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><volume>24</volume><fpage>2151</fpage><lpage>2157</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16682733</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040209-b016"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name><name><surname>Cho</surname><given-names>JY</g